  "description": "“Woojin, you’ve really grown up. You’ve gotten so tall. All grown up.” \n\nRight now, Haeyun was drawing her friend’s bare body.    \nJust as promised, without a single thread on. \n\nHaeyun's gaze persistently explored Woojin's entire body, lines tracing down along that gaze. Her eyes and hands groped him at the same time. \n\n“Stop moving and stay still.” \n\nHaeyun spoke with a strained, calm voice toward Woojin, who was posing while sitting on a chair. However, her pupils were trembling like mad. \n\nWoojin wasn't moving at all, save for breathing slowly.   \nExcept for one single part.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \nR19: [RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/5285003014)   \nR15: [RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/5285003015)",
